s:</b><br /> Twenty-Fifth Merciful - I'm assuming the other characters think (s)he is a companion of Joachim<br /> <br /> <b>Other Characters</b>:<br /> Xisa - Knows that Orca is a Solar","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-19-2015, 12:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T14:04:23-08:00","id":429285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=429266#post429266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Xisa - Knows that Orca is a Solar?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. And anyone else who'd like to have been involved in their merry chase.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T19:11:27-08:00","id":429624,"title":"","content":"Twenty-fifth Merciful certainly knows of Marian's status as a Deathknight in 'service' to the Bishop. However, Marian isn't either hiding or offering the information of what he is. He doesn't think it needs to be flaunted, but he realizes that others would use the information that he is something other against him. When it comes to Anathema, Abyssals fit the stereotypical bill. He would come across as a reclusive scholar at first. He would also be very careful about overt displays of power.<br /> <br /> tl;dr: He isn't shouting it from the main mast, but he will not deny it if asked.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:23:05-08:00","id":430760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=430744#post430744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The scroll is not what you expected. Although, upon reflection, you're not sure what you expected. The scroll turns out to contain a variety of comics in Old Realm. Called &quot;Hai and Roishi,&quot; it depicts a male Unclean (Twilight) and a female Frenzied (Full Moon) vacillating between being incredibly introspective and being incredibly crass with one another. Of particular note is the incredibly low-brow tack of the humor, which seems to revolve around sexual situations or the two protagonists molesting one another. A memorable strip was where Roishi the Unclean commented that MRL's taxation plan was like Hai in that it poked him in the eye at inopportune moments, all while Hai is in a half-Human, half-Spotted Hyena visage, flustered at the comment. A hawkish female figure called MRL, usually accompanied by another woman in tacky glowing wings appeared every so often, usually to be the butt of some joke, while another recurring character, Za Maganasa, seemed to generally earn high fives and be an all-round cool guy, even if all he did was show up and wear sunglasses.<br /> <br /> Truly, this was an artifact from a dark point in history...<br /> <br /> The reader doesn't notice you. What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I want this comic. Both in game and in real life. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:52:03-08:00","id":430810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=430760#post430760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I want this comic. Both in game and in real life. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I brainstormed this last night during work after thinking that this was funnier than &quot;Your Airship and You: A Newcomer's Guide to Avionics,&quot; and did some doodles. I don't think an actual comic would be out till next week, though, so don't get any high hopes up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T17:02:35-08:00","id":430845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=430810#post430810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I brainstormed this last night during work after thinking that this was funnier than &quot;Your Airship and You: A Newcomer's Guide to Avionics,&quot; and did some doodles. I don't think an actual comic would be out till next week, though, so don't get any high hopes up.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait? This is going to be an actual comic? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T17:06:07-08:00","id":430850,"title":"","content":"I was considering it, as I draw a little as a hobby, but you convinced me I ought to draw out at least one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T18:45:42-08:00","id":430960,"title":"","content":"Can Unrestrained Lover use his Incomparable Efficiency Upgrade to speed up the cleaning of the warehouse ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T05:59:08-07:00","id":432565,"title":"","content":"First, I absolutely love Exalted comics, and you should totally make that comic, Dietaku.<br /> <br /> Second, I hope if anybody's making any sweet new improved airship designs they'll come to Nergui first. I didn't take all those dots in Sail because I <i>don't</i> want a sweet magitech airship and to become the Haslanti League's most famed sky captain!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:01:41-07:00","id":432767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=432565#post432565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First, I absolutely love Exalted comics, and you should totally make that comic, Dietaku.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been telling him similar things for years. Hopefully now that other voices are chiming in he'll listen!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=432565#post432565\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Second, I hope if anybody's making any sweet new improved airship designs they'll come to Nergui first. I didn't take all those dots in Sail because I <i>don't</i> want a sweet magitech airship and to become the Haslanti League's most famed sky captain!</div> </div> </div> </div>If we make a super awesome magi tech sky-cruiser for Nergui, I vote we give it Lightning Ballistae broadsides. Only, instead of lightning <i>ballistae</i>, they're giant gilded statues of the Circle that lob javelins of holy sky-fire at our foes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:06:51-07:00","id":432772,"title":"","content":"Nergui is first on our list! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm sort of sad that most of the Solar Sail charms require ownership/being in charge of the ship. I don't want Zarah to steal Nergui's thunder. Anyways, there are plenty of Ride charms to buy instead. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:25:36-07:00","id":432814,"title":"","content":"Airships for everyone let's make our own fleet this way everybody gets an airship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T20:21:46-07:00","id":433532,"title":"","content":"@Magnusar: Yeah, sure, that seems okay.Go ahead and speed-clean that sumbitch.<br /> <br /> @Noodle and @Wise Old Guru: You convinced me. I lack a good scanner or tablet, so feel free to berate me for the shittiness of the comic's pictoral quality, but I'll see if I can get something out by the end of the week. <br /> <br /> @Wise Old Guru<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />2): Lukas did mention he knew where the remains of a First Age skyship were...<br /> <br /> @Noodle(2): Isn't that from that one movie you saw before?<br /> <br /> I'll update things tomorrow. Until then, you all have a good one. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T19:09:00-07:00","id":435078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=432814#post432814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Airships for everyone let's make our own fleet this way everybody gets an airship.</div> </div> </div> </div>A flying soulsteel frigate that fires the very essence of Oblivion with it's broadsides? Where do I sign up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T19:23:25-07:00","id":435109,"title":"","content":"Right here if you have the soulsteel <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T12:21:41-07:00","id":436044,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://s15.postimg.org/4yuz5npyz/Hi_Roishi_1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> You asked for it, and here it is. Spoiler'd because it's huge, and also because, while it's not NSFW, it's sill not entirely kid-friendly. Look at your own peril. <br /> <br /> Also, apologies for lack of posting yesterday, Monster Hunter happened. I'll be updating now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T12:26:44-07:00","id":436048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=436044#post436044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://s15.postimg.org/4yuz5npyz/Hi_Roishi_1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Truly, this was a dark point in history. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T16:54:42-07:00","id":436421,"title":"","content":"Monster Hunter does seem like it would be a time sink. I have only ever played a little of Monster Hunter Freedom on the PSP. That little bit of it, though seemed very promising. If only we could have similar mechanics in other games, I would be all for that. Too many games, especially MMOs turn the furs, teeth, and claws of monsters that you kill into trash/vendor loots and don't think of the other things that can be done with them. It seems very lazy when it could be used as a mini-game or even as a means of making a crafting system that is more than just gather these goods and make a specific item. For instance, you could use a bone to make the handle for a sword instead of wood or an extra piece of steel. You could do this with basically the same recipe, you would just have a different chance of success and different properties would come from one over the other. Yeah, 'crafting' systems are a sticking point for me in MMOs. Hence why I don't get into most of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T17:05:47-07:00","id":436433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Belkra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=436421#post436421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Monster Hunter does seem like it would be a time sink. I have only ever played a little of Monster Hunter Freedom on the PSP. That little bit of it, though seemed very promising. If only we could have similar mechanics in other games, I would be all for that. Too many games, especially MMOs turn the furs, teeth, and claws of monsters that you kill into trash/vendor loots and don't think of the other things that can be done with them. It seems very lazy when it could be used as a mini-game or even as a means of making a crafting system that is more than just gather these goods and make a specific item. For instance, you could use a bone to make the handle for a sword instead of wood or an extra piece of steel. You could do this with basically the same recipe, you would just have a different chance of success and different properties would come from one over the other. Yeah, 'crafting' systems are a sticking point for me in MMOs. Hence why I don't get into most of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Funny you should mention that, because I'm largely basing the premise off the Etrian Odyssey games, which do something similar: you kill monster, monsters drop loots. You sell loots in town, and this opens up new weapons, armors, and generally increases prosperity in the town. In short, the town itself benefits from the hunting and exploring you do. If you guys were to kill powerful beasts, by all means, forge stuff out of their remains, I would actively encourage such things. <br /> <br /> @Wonderandawe: I'm glad you enjoy it. I may do more, but not this week. It took several hours to do that one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T05:46:07-07:00","id":436922,"title":"","content":"I approve of this theme for the game, especially the &quot;the town benefits from it&quot; part.<br /> <br /> Sorta hoping for Nergui to put down some roots. His goal is to build this little town into a powerhouse for the Haslanti League, after all.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T06:54:59-07:00","id":437003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=436433#post436433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Wonderandawe: I'm glad you enjoy it. I may do more, but not this week. It took several hours to do that one.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll fully admit I don't understand what happened with the Fwoosh part. And I am putting my vote in for &quot;Pattern Spiders are not Construction Materials&quot;. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T16:50:18-07:00","id":437709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=437003#post437003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll fully admit I don't understand what happened with the Fwoosh part. And I am putting my vote in for &quot;Pattern Spiders are not Construction Materials&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry for not entirely being obvious. Roishi is flipping his arms up, and creating a wind/ jostling Hi enough that she has a wardrobe malfunction. That this is possible with enough effort as Roishi's original point, while the result was something entirely unexpected, even to him. <br /> <br /> Also, something to note is that the titles I gave were supposed to be akin to titles of comic collections. Think about all the Calvin and Hobbes or Garfield books you've seen. They tend to have bad puns/ non sequiturs as their titles. So, while I wasn't trying to offer options for new comics there, although if you really want to see them, well, I suppose I could do them. <br /> <br /> @Wise Old Guru: Well, if you do try and map out the Labyrinth, you probably would massively improve the lives of the citizens in Last Chance, so there's that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T12:44:32-07:00","id":440320,"title":"","content":"Really !? He has a book too !? A tactical manual !? I thought magitech was suppose to be rare as hell. What's next the barman has an essence powered drink mixer (joke)<br /> <br /> Sorry I just thought that this was suppose to be kinda really Blackwater and I was repeatedly told IRL that magitech was very rare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T12:47:55-07:00","id":440335,"title":"","content":"Can I roll Linguistics to see why this particular mention of Rehhanz caused a reaction? Has Zarah just said the name too many times?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T12:55:07-07:00","id":440348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440320#post440320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really !? He has a book too !? A tactical manual !? I thought magitech was suppose to be rare as hell. What's next the barman has an essence powered drink mixer (joke)<br /> <br /> Sorry I just thought that this was suppose to be kinda really Blackwater and I was repeatedly told IRL that magitech was very rare.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's 3E.<br /> <br /> In 2E there are still functional servers of the magical internet lying around, thousands of magical ICBMs all over the world, and any city with a dot on the map has magic lighting, sewers, and weapon caches. Also, it is apparently possible to create sentient magitech by accident as evidenced by Icemind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:08:01-07:00","id":440383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440348#post440348\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 2E there are still functional servers of the magical internet lying around, thousands of magical ICBMs all over the world, and any city with a dot on the map has magic lighting, sewers, and weapon caches. Also, it is apparently possible to create sentient magitech by accident as evidenced by Icemind.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll admit I have a soft spot for 2E crazy magitech distribution. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:09:54-07:00","id":440385,"title":"","content":"@Magnusar: It is rare. Rare, though, as Noodle put it, is relative. Also, Exthalion has a solid point. Ruins of the forgotten age of spirit-iphones, cloud cars, jetpacks, and talking robot nannies, litter Creation. You're also in an unusual place, so that may have something to do with it? I guess you'll have to find out. <br /> <br /> Also, I'm leery of &quot;magical tools, weapons and armor&quot; being rare in 3e, when everyone and their mother I've seen seems to want evocations, which, in turn, requires artifacts.The King is dead, Long live the King, I suppose.<br /> <br /> @WonderandAwe: That's fine. Alterntively, you could ask. Either or. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:10:44-07:00","id":440386,"title":"","content":"Well it sucks whats the point of making a character that crafts magitech if you only need to scavenge to find weapons of mass destruction.<br /> <br /> Okay I'm exagerating a bit but still I feel a bit cheated. I took a celestial battle armor in Forging a nation and I'm still a bit surprise noodle let me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-13-2015, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:18:32-07:00","id":440396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440386#post440386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it sucks whats the point of making a character that crafts magitech if you only need to scavenge to find weapons of mass destruction.<br /> <br /> Okay I'm exagerating a bit but still I feel a bit cheated I took a celestial battle armor un Forging a nation and I'm still a bit surprise noodle let me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Most magitech is found broken or breaks easily. So your crafter is a glorified repairman (I kid. I kid)<br /> <br /> My first Exalted Game, Magitech basically rained from the sky. My current Skype exalted game, the only magitech we find is stuff that fits with the ST's plot. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:19:41-07:00","id":440399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440386#post440386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it sucks whats the point of making a character that crafts magitech if you only need to scavenge to find weapons of mass destruction.<br /> <br /> Okay I'm exagerating a bit but still I feel a bit cheated I took a celestial battle armor un Forging a nation and I'm still a bit surprise noodle let me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I run into that problem all the time. It helps that you can do lesser crafting really well if you can create magitech. That, and there are like 9 stated characters who can make Artifact 5 and that includes Ligier and the Unconquered Sun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 03-13-2015, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:35:00-07:00","id":440426,"title":"","content":"Magical repairman is one thing, rebuilding what the hundreds of Celestial Exalts had is another. Also, Noodle and i tend to not say no to our players. if they want something, and it's not markedly out of hand then it usually gets the go-ahead. <br /> <br /> That being said, I usually opt for finding artifacts because that sidesteps the 2e craft system, which is a finicky wonky mess in a system that already is a finicky mess. All the more kudos for braving that, Magnusar, but I never would want to. <br /> <br /> Also, ultimately, I'm a sucker for the First Age as a time of high technology, decadence, and general tomfoolery with magic, which you already have seen a bit. having your prior incarnations leave behind an inheritance of magical loot, for me at least, is a cool way to look into your past lives' history and at Creation in the past as well. <br /> <br /> Hopefully that helps answer your questions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:40:25-07:00","id":440431,"title":"","content":"In dreams of the first age, in contentious sword write up it is said that his CBA is a recent construction from his circle mate but I get your point it's just frustrating that it takes so much to build it. I didn't think that I would build magitech weapons in the first few post but still the fact that it takes a season per roll to build the thing makes it a challenge to build the damn things.<br /> <br /> Maybe making a craftsman was not such a great idea after all but let's see for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-13-2015, 05:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:34:18-07:00","id":440475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=440473#post440473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;You stated his name. His true name. It is a thing that people fail to realize, but names carry power. Re***hanz is from a time beyond the dawn of Time, a being that predates Humanity. He is not entirely happy, I'd imagine, and wished it to be known. The others refer to him as &quot;Rehhanz, &quot; a corruption of the term I use. I trust you have not been to the Wyld, then. Otherwise, you'd know this,&quot; Zan says, calling for another drink with a smirk.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ha! That is what I get from copying and pasting from the wrong post! I did not realize that there were two different names. Opps.<br /> <br /> I did a search and saw that Zarah has never heard the true name of the beast. Can we just say she knew it based on something from a previous incarnation?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-13-2015, 05:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:38:47-07:00","id":440485,"title":"","content":"It may have been a slip on my part. Reinhanz is the name of one of my Lunar's forms, the so-called &quot;King of Gazelles.&quot; I figured I'd use it again, a sort of racial echo to the forerunner of all hoofed beings. When you used it, I figured I could throw you all a curveball.<br /> <br /> That, and Zarah is so fun to bully. Poor Patrician, she's realizing how out of her element she is now, I'm sure. (This is all in fun, please don't take it the wrong way, Wonderandawe )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:39:21-07:00","id":440486,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440386#post440386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it sucks whats the point of making a character that crafts magitech if you only need to scavenge to find weapons of mass destruction.<br /> <br /> Okay I'm exagerating a bit but still I feel a bit cheated. I took a celestial battle armor in Forging a nation and I'm still a bit surprise noodle let me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ess'Tee works in mysterious ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:43:55-07:00","id":440490,"title":"","content":"No. It's fine! That's the whole point of her character! She is totally out of her element. Plenty of room for character growth. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm really looking forward to when she get to let loose. Hiding as a Solar on the Blessed Isle for almost a year was rough on her. Very unnatural situation for a solar. I don't think she has ever used enough essence to get her Anima up to Totemic.<br /> <br /> Though I have no clue what her past incarnations were up to until now. I kind of want her First Age Incarnation to be this rough and tumble world traveler now. Complete opposite to what Zarah is now. (Though something she might grow into)<br /> <br /> Maybe her First Age Circle would go Reinhanz baiting when they were bored?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T15:29:03-07:00","id":440521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440431#post440431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In dreams of the first age, in contentious sword write up it is said that his CBA is a recent construction from his circle mate but I get your point it's just frustrating that it takes so much to build it. I didn't think that I would build magitech weapons in the first few post but still the fact that it takes a season per roll to build the thing makes it a challenge to build the damn things.<br /> <br /> Maybe making a craftsman was not such a great idea after all but let's see for now.</div> </div> </div> </div>I get ya, I can understand why, though. Building such a thing would be time-consuming and expensive. However, 3 months per roll is...a thing. Granted, Solars, Abyssals and Infernals all have charms to ameliorate this downtime. I don't recall anything for Alchemicals, but I think that it wouldn't be too much of a stretch to give them one, considering their patron is the Lord of Tinker Toys. <br /> <br /> I think ultimately, it goes down to how fast does the game become about creating new machines to solve issues, versus dealing with the sixteen apocalypse pileup that Creation is facing at present.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T16:31:57-07:00","id":440586,"title":"","content":"I already have it equiped right now along with another one that let you do multiple checks I think. Dont worry I checked they also have one that let you reduce the prerequisite like the solar.<br /> <br /> This one of the thing that I dont like in canon creation, it's a bit too apocalytic for me. I mean I like a good apocalypse to keep thing interesting but 20 to 30 at the same time is a bit much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-13-2015, 07:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T16:43:31-07:00","id":440623,"title":"","content":"The sad thing is that the Alchemical speed multiplier caps at E*2 for individuals. You can add E to other people, meaning they make great assistants or work together fantastically. The flurry any action thing work by RAW, but some people worry about it in other things.<br /> <br /> As for Creation: Do you mean too many in the past or too many going on at the same time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T16:46:08-07:00","id":440629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440586#post440586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This one of the thing that I dont like in canon creation, it's a bit too apocalytic for me. I mean I like a good apocalypse to keep thing interesting but 20 to 30 at the same time is a bit much.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have the same issue. If I ever run an Exalted game, there are going to be major time skips (five, ten, maybe even a hundred years. Depends on the power level of the game). Gives people time to build something between apocalyptic crisis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T16:52:52-07:00","id":440636,"title":"","content":"Too many at the same time and too fast we can't spend years to raise kingdoms or grow in strenght and age like the other exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T16:58:20-07:00","id":440644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440636#post440636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Too many at the same time and too fast we can't spend years to raise kingdoms or grow in strenght and age like the other exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>In Exalted, I'm a big long term planner. My Twilight wants to raise the general education level of the north (and eventually all of creation). My Joybringer wants to start a Pro-Solar Counter Cultural Movement based on Music. Zarah seems to be going towards starting the industrial revolution here in Last Chance with all of these crafters she has joined up with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T17:13:16-07:00","id":440649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440644#post440644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zarah seems to be going towards starting the industrial revolution here in Last Chance with all of these crafters she has joined up with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Race you to the information age! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> You work on the tech side, I'll get the means of production organized to support it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T17:22:35-07:00","id":440655,"title":"","content":"I agree with Wonderandawe, although I've never been in a game that lasted long enough for us to get to that point. Usually, my group's games had us wander around, and begin to get an agenda, and then circumstances would end it there.<br /> <br /> I find that having all these swords over your head can be helpful for STs so that it's not just &quot;Kobolds invade, wat do?&quot; and allows for a variety of enemies with the opportunity for a circle to be able to not only handle them, but use unconventional tactics if they want to. Granted, I personally feel that certain ones are blown out of proportion and others are underutilized, but I can't help the general bad blood that seems to run through the fandom regarding them.<br /> <br /> (In case I wasn't entirely clear, I mean the Reclamation is blown out of proportion. Seriously, five days through a desert that hates you isn't easy, you guys. Especially when Prophet of One-Shot Kill can pop in from a shadowland with an army of ghosts, kill a village and use that to expand the shadowland further. And can GSPs do anything similar? Sure, especially if they want a constant klaxon going off at their hub of operations going &quot;A DEMON THING IS HAPPENING HERE, SEND A WYLD HUNT TO FIGHT BADDIES&quot; to all the Sidereals even casually looking at the Loom. And while I'm usually not a fan of &quot;Surprise sneak attack behind a teacup&quot; Sidereals, I find it hard to justify not having at least some resistance show up when they start pulling that stuff.<br /> <br /> I suppose it was because late 2e, infernals were the new hotness, and the Ink Monkeys were only to happy to provide. I just find it amusing that the guys who gave us the &quot;Let's give Solars a way to do Gilgamesh's thing from Fate/Stay Night&quot; charm and &quot;Here's a way your Lunar can do all that DBT stuff without being an icky furry even when you have pretty much total control over their appearance,&quot; knack also say,&quot; Nuh-uh, man, Reclamation can't happen, 2e Infernals are kill, Solars are getting weaker, Everything is a MISTERY now.&quot;)<br /> <br /> As an aside, I'd like to say that I think the Legend of the Titans is an amazing piece of fluff, and I adore their setting works. Just that I feel like a lot of what is complained about 2e was exacerbated by them, is all.<br /> <br /> Sorry, I'll get off my soapbox now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 03-13-2015, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T17:30:37-07:00","id":440663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440655#post440655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with Wonderandawe, although I've never been in a game that lasted long enough for us to get to that point. Usually, my group's games had us wander around, and begin to get an agenda, and then circumstances would end it there.<br /> <br /> I find that having all these swords over your head can be helpful for STs so that it's not just &quot;Kobolds invade, wat do?&quot; and allows for a variety of enemies with the opportunity for a circle to be able to not only handle them, but use unconventional tactics if they want to. Granted, I personally feel that certain ones are blown out of proportion and others are underutilized, but I can't help the general bad blood that seems to run through the fandom regarding them.<br /> <br /> (In case I wasn't entirely clear, I mean the Reclamation is blown out of proportion. Seriously, five days through a desert that hates you isn't easy, you guys. Especially when Prophet of One-Shot Kill can pop in from a shadowland with an army of ghosts, kill a village and use that to expand the shadowland further. And can GSPs do anything similar? Sure, especially if they want a constant klaxon going off at their hub of operations going &quot;A DEMON THING IS HAPPENING HERE, SEND A WYLD HUNT TO FIGHT BADDIES&quot; to all the Sidereals even casually looking at the Loom. And while I'm usually not a fan of surprise sneak attack behind a teacup Sidereals, I find it hard to jsutify not having at least some resistance show up when they start pulling that stuff.<br /> <br /> I suppose it was because late 2e, infernals were the new hotness, and the Ink Monkeys were only to happy to provide. I just find it amusing that the guys who gave us the &quot;Let's give Solars a way to do Gilgamesh's thing from Fate/Stay Night&quot; charm and &quot;Here's a way your Lunar can do all that DBT stuff without being an icky furry even when you have pretty much total control over their appearance,&quot; knack also say,&quot; Nuh-uh, man, Reclamation can't happen, 2e Infernals are kill, Solars are getting weaker, Everything is a MISTERY now.&quot;)<br /> <br /> Sorry, I'll get off my soapbox now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Chirality Prohibition Index. E2, no prereqs, stackable, sorcerous.<br /> <br /> The Sidereals can kiss my immaculately organized communist Utopia<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T17:37:14-07:00","id":440667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440663#post440663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Chirality Prohibition Index. E2, no prereqs, stackable, sorcerous.<br /> <br /> The Sidereals can kiss my immaculately organized communist Utopia<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\"