"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Race you to the information age! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> You work on the tech side, I'll get the means of production organized to support it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Deal! Let's do this! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440655#post440655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with Wonderandawe, although I've never been in a game that lasted long enough for us to get to that point. Usually, my group's games had us wander around, and begin to get an agenda, and then circumstances would end it there.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've had the same problem. Or it turns out that the game wasn't really designed for my long term plans. I'm pretty sure my Joybringer won't be able to start his counter cultural movement. I'll just have to tuck that idea away for another game. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T18:01:32-07:00","id":440698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440677#post440677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like Sidereals, in a &quot;Wow, our previous incarnations fucked up creation and how we have to fix it.&quot; way. Also, I find corrupt heavenly politics interesting. Infernals I don't like, but apparently the chapter fluff in the Infernal book sucks and the charms tell the real story about the Infernals. I just gave up on the book before I got that far.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I've heard a number of suggestions from ignoring the chapter fluff to using a weird inverse of the general Sidereal story of &quot;Elders take you to Heaven, you train and then go out to kick butt.&quot; The main draw for Infernals for me is the demons. That and the prehsitory aspect. While the Sidereals can hang out with the Maidens, your bosses are the masters of the world who basically made everything work as it does today. You have access to magics and artifacts not seen since before the Primordial War. That's pretty neat stuff.<br /> <br /> The trick is getting back to Creation and not getting ganked by a Sidereal or Wyld Hunt because you decided it would be really funny to use your Green Sun Nimbus Flare combo and you accidentally killed an entire town in a flash of green.<br /> <br /> I like Sidereals a lot, too. I tend to run them as &quot;The office, but with Ninjas,&quot; which is always amsuing to me. I just wish that they had had their errata charms before. And Astrology wasn't so unintuitive. But, what you gonna do, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T18:06:39-07:00","id":440704,"title":"","content":"I never got to read the other exalted except alchemicals. There is enough to keep me busy just with the solars (I like playing the shining golden hero) and the others don't interest me that much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T18:07:38-07:00","id":440705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=440698#post440698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like Sidereals a lot, too. I tend to run 