ce asked my IRL ST to play one and he looked at like I was an alien.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-13-2015, 09:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T18:34:33-07:00","id":440746,"title":"","content":"No. I think Dreams of the First Age was suppose to have charms that allow you to play an elder, but apparently a lot of the charms in the book are unplayable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T18:44:21-07:00","id":440751,"title":"","content":"Hmm I heard about that but with the ink monkeys and the errata I though that was fixed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T20:02:53-07:00","id":440810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"