 border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T15:10:10-07:00","id":658437,"title":"","content":"@Belkra: It's not really angsty drama. More Telenovela-level, where everyone is related or knows each other, which is made into this huge tweest, when it really ought not be. The social web gets pretty complex, but it's also charming in its own weird way. I'd also recommend stopping after Kaioh is defeated. The last 60 or so chapters drag on with no real payoffs. All in all a good read, but the last little bit is not really necesary.<br /> <br /> @Wonderandawe: I try. <br /> <br /> Also, apologies. I tried, but nothing came to me for Hi and Roishi. However, I have soemthing else I'm working on as a replacement. I think you'll all like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T09:55:41-07:00","id":663244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=658437#post658437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Belkra: It's not really angsty drama. More Telenovela-level, where everyone is related or knows each other, which is made into this huge tweest, when it really ought not be. The social web gets pretty complex, but it's also charming in its own weird way. I'd also recommend stopping after Kaioh is defeated. The last 60 or so chapters drag on with no real payoffs. All in all a good read, but the last little bit is not really necesary.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do like a little bit of angst, or even a whole truckload if it is done well. I love classical Gothic stuff after all (Stoker, Shelly, Poe).<br /> <br /> Episodes that drag on with nothing really to show? Sounds like everything past Freiza in Dragonball.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T15:16:02-07:00","id":664869,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it tries to tie up things, but feels very flat. I'd just skip it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T06:42:57-07:00","id":665649,"title":"","content":"This may be meta gaming, but are you guys heading to the pub or should I head to the warehouse?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T07:51:13-07:00","id":682030,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Going back to the Warehouse. Let's get this show on the road! Time to brave the Emerald Labyrinth! (Since our Lunar Captain got eaten by the Iron Works. )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T08:15:24-07:00","id":682076,"title":"","content":"I would be more interested in mounting an expedition to get the crashed magitech ship. As for money if we can get our hands on enough raw materials good quality equipment must be in high demands around the labyrinth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 09-29-2015, 11:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T08:28:29-07:00","id":682107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnusar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=682076#post682076\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yay let's get eaten by monsters in the dark of the labyrinth, there is no way the lover can build the weapons for the group in 24 hours even if he doesn't sleep, I would be more interested in mounting an expedition to get the crashed magitech ship. As for money if we can get our hands on enough raw materials good quality equipment must be in high demands around the labyrinth.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm not really interested either. But it seem like our NPC guide is running off into the Wilderness without us, so I'm taking that as a subtle ST hint to get our PCs asses into the Labyrinth ASAP.<br /> <br /> (Or maybe I am just metagaming a bit too much. Seriously, I'm just trying to keep the party together and help move plot along! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 09-29-2015, 11:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T12:13:14-07:00","id":683369,"title":"","content":"For now I think we should stay in town to better settle in before leaving for an expedition into the labyrinth and my character is not combat oriented for now at least <br /> <br /> Dietaku can the wood in the warehouse be used as exotic ingredient albeit a minor one I would like to build this <br /> <br /> Maker\u2019s Drafting Board (Artifact 3)<br /> Attunement Cost: 8m<br /> Activation Cost: None<br /> Maintenance: None<br /> <br /> The Artificer\u2019s Codex (Library of Azun Sol, Second Repository, Row 3, Shelf 81) describes an incomparable first age wonder known as Autocthon\u2019s Workbench, said to allow its user to fabricate objects from pure essence with the stroke of a stylus. While the Maker\u2019s Drafting Board cannot manage that feat, its other functions are clearly inspired by the device.<br /> <br /> The Drafting Board is a simple looking desk of rare wood, its top angled downward and inlaid with a precise grid-work of orichalcum. When a craftsman draws a set of plans using the surface, the artifact allows him to project them in three dimensions, rotate, enlarge, and edit them with ease. The Board can also simulate essence flow and physical dynamics, allowing the user to concept check his work before building.<br /> <br /> The Maker\u2019s Drafting Board adds three successes to any Craft check made to design and build a new Artifact or Manse, protecting the user from botches, and speeding the crafting process over the long run. Attuning the Board requires the commitment of eight motes.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T12:31:01-07:00","id":683433,"title":"","content":"How long do you think we will need to take in town? We could always find another NPC guide, but my character has a month before the King of Hoof comes for her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T13:11:26-07:00","id":683456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=683433#post683433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How long do you think we will need to take in town? We could always find another NPC guide, but my character has a month before the King of Hoof comes for her.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Depends if we get the right connections and the right friends, could be a piece of cake but there is a infernal loose in town mayhem will follow soon I bet.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T17:21:47-07:00","id":690614,"title":"","content":"I'm not trying to run you guys in any way. I set up Alma to be a way for you all to see what' s actually in the Labyrinth, while having a guide familiar with it. I mean , the game IS about dungeon crawling, so.....<br /> <br /> But don' t think I' m going to penalize you ( too much) for being cautious.<br /> <br /> @Magnusar. The warehouse' s contents were left deliberately vague to allow you to rummage through them for his such purposes. So go ahead, I like the cut of your gib.<br /> <br /> Also, I will withhold judgement or comment on Exthaliom' s plan til I see more of it in action.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T17:30:43-07:00","id":690622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth?p=690614#post690614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not trying to run you guys in any way. I set up Alma to be a way for you all to see what' s actually in the Labyrinth, while having a guide familiar with it. I mean , the game IS about dungeon crawling, so.....<br /> <br /> But don' t think I' m going to penalize you ( too much) for being cautious.<br /> <br /> @Magnusar. The warehouse' s contents were left deliberately vague to allow you to rummage through them for his such purposes. So go ahead, I like the cut of your gib.<br /> <br /> Also, I will withhold judgement or comment on Exthaliom' s plan til I see more of it in action.</div> </div> </div> </div>Out of character, I'm fine with waiting and getting settled. In character, Zarah is kind of annoyed that Zan, whom she hired, is going off to the dangerous labyrinth on another mission. She knew she should have gotten some kind of Exclusive contract with him. Also, there is the fact that Zarah has a month to get into the Labyrinth, find this King of Hoof and reason with it. So, she might be rushing now, but she'd be willing to slow down if someone talks her down. Zarah is very much out of her element here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}